      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그릇을 80%나 할인해서 판다구요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "お皿を80％も安くしてくださるのですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_TRADER_CHEATER"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "물론이지요! 원래 물건을 팔던 곳이 망해버려서, 싸게 재고정리 중입니다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もちろんです！長年世話になった取引先が廃業してしまいまして、売り尽くしセール中でございます。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_TRADER_CHEATER"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "파격의 80% 할인! 지금 아니면 만날 수 없는 기회!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "破格の80%セール！今だけのチャンスですよ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAGICIAN_DRUID",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그렇네요… 당장 그릇이 필요하진 않았는데… ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そうですね、お皿が今すぐは必要ないかもしれませんが… ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_TRADER_CHEATER"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "사두면 다 언젠가 쓰지 않겠습니까? 자아, 자아…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "買っておくといずれ使うものですよ、はい。さあさあ…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
