      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "EmotionEffect": "QMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네에?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "はい？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 29,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_TRADER_CHEATER"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "으… 으그그극… 그… 그건…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "う…うぐぐっ…そ…それは…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 30,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgCrash": 0.5,
      "BgCrashTime": 1.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "발뺌하려 해도 소용없소! 어제 지나가다가 본 그릇이니까.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "言い逃れしようとも無駄である！昨日通りすがりに見かけた皿なのだからな。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 31,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "저 그릇에 볶음국수를 담아서 먹으면 보기도 좋고 맛도 좋겠네…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あの皿に焼きそばを乗せると、見た目も良いし美味しそうだな—",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 32,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgCrash": 0.5,
      "BgCrashTime": 2.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "EmotionEffect": "UPSET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…하고 생각했던 그 그릇이니까!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…と思っていた皿だからな！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
